 and improvisation. You can also use in-game hint system if things get too hard. With 80 levels plus hidden and bonus bridges to construct you will not run out of things to do quickly.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/694110/extras/28420c9310c46ade8991eff54332f1ee.avif?t=1759493551\" width=580 height=129 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Different materials to build from - Wood, Metal, Cables</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- 86 levels of increasingly difficult puzzles</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Varied, detailed environments full of interactive elements</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Multiple cars to test out your constructions</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Realistic physics engine</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Beautiful, stylized art style</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Available in 15 languages</p></li></ul>","developers":["BoomBit"],"genres":[{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/694110/5e9910e320d699bf6384e52a4cace68cc385490d/header.jpg?t=1759493551","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"\u00a9 2010 - 2025, BoomBit Games Ltd. & BoomBit S.A. or its affiliates. All rights reserved","linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> macOS 10.15 or newer<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Only<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 2 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 1 GB available space</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS